{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜10月29日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261029.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】以色列大選投票結束，投票率創下紀錄，總理內塔尼亞胡領導的執政陣營與反對派陣營，均未能取得國會過半數議席，關鍵「造王者」如何左右政壇大局？</p><p>周三《時事全方位》，請來學者分析。</p><p>題目：解讀以色列大選</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T02:00:59.604256+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:58:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:58:28.267731+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T01:58:18.828326+00:00","content_hash":"cd4cc7743f085e16181097d3351b2c075a71ebab6b2cb6e3fe5accba2604f2c7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}